    LLM: "Fixed sequence of four poker variants. Hold'em and Omaha use blinds; Seven-Card Stud and Eight or Better use antes and a compulsory bring-in. All played as limit. A complete round of each game is played before rotating to the next. Best hand at showdown wins the pot.",
    Player: "Fixed sequence of four poker variants. Hold'em and Omaha use blinds; Seven-Card Stud and Eight or Better use antes and a compulsory bring-in. All played as limit. A complete round of each game is played before rotating to the next. Best hand at showdown wins the pot.",
